    92→### Windows
    …
    94→On Windows, use [Chocolatey](https://chocolatey.org)
    96→```
    97→choco install mkcert
    98→```
    100→or use Scoop
    102→```
    103→scoop bucket add extras
    104→scoop install mkcert
    105→```
    107→or build from source (requires Go 1.10+), or use [the pre-built binaries](https://github.com/FiloSottile/mkcert/releases).
    109→If you're running into permission problems try running `mkcert` as an Administrator.
